  "comments": "Native of Nyang stod Mang ra ba (or Mang rab) born in sTag gi rGya ma ra ba in the vicinity of rBa brCad, known as \"rGya 'Dul 'dzin the elder\" to distinguish him from \"rGya 'Dul 'dzin the younger\" (ID:4193). See [647FFPZR]: 541. See also [UGZJBIWM]: 376.\r\n\r\nDisciple of Zhang zhung pa rGyal ba'i shes rab and Ye shes\r\nbla ma in sTod, gZhon tshul in 'Dzims and 'Brom Seng dkar in dBus. His disciples include sTon pa Yang rab from Glo bo, the elder and younger Brag ston in western gTsang, the elder Leng and the younger 'Brog, and 'Gar (=Rong pa 'Gar dGe ba gsal), 'Gos (=rje 'Gos) and Yol (=Yol Chos dbang) ([Q922IUFM]: 1: 98).",
  "alternative_names_legacy": "rgya dbang phyug tshul khrims 'bar",
